CIVILIZATIONCLONE — CIV1-INSPIRED UI REFERENCE
ANSII SUPPLEMENT: SYSTEM, MENUS, TURN STATES (CIV1-UI-058..085)

STYLE: <TITLE> <FOCUS> <ACTION> <INFO> <WARN> <MUTED>

[CIV1-UI-058] CREDITS / OPENING CREDITS
╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ <TITLE>                    SID MEIER'S CIVILIZATION                        ║
║                              by MPS Labs                                     ║
║                     design / art / music credits                            ║
║ <ACTION>                         [ CONTINUE ]                                ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

